$$
7245_{8}*17_{8}=7245_{8}*(20-1)_{8}
$$

$$
=165120_{8}-7245_{8}
$$

$$
=155653_{8}
$$

Multiplication by $20_8$ means double the number and then append one octal zero: $7245_8\cdot2_8=16512_8$, then $165120_8$. Subtract $7245_8$ to obtain $155653_8$. Alternatively, $7245_8=3749$ and $17_8=15$, so the decimal product is 56235, which converts back to the same octal result.
